UnitV2Gauge::Earned
├── when the gauge has no staked supply
│   ├── it should not query the voter projection
│   └── it should return zero
├── when the account has no accrued emissions
│   └── it should return zero
├── when the account has only deferred LP emissions
│   ├── it should return the deferred LP emissions
│   └── it should exclude referral emissions credited to the account
├── when the account has accrued and deferred LP emissions
│   ├── it should apply penalty and referral deductions only to live emissions
│   ├── it should include deferred LP emissions
│   └── it should exclude referral emissions credited to the account
└── when the account has accrued emissions
    ├── when there is no penalty and no referral
    │   ├── when the reward per token is known
    │   │   ├── it should return full emissions
    │   │   └── it should align claimed emissions with earned
    │   └── when the reward per token varies
    │       ├── it should return full emissions
    │       └── it should align claimed emissions with earned
    ├── when there is a penalty rate
    │   ├── when called within min stake blocks
    │   │   └── it should return emissions after penalty
    │   └── when called after min stake blocks
    │       └── it should return full emissions
    ├── when there is a referral share
    │   └── it should return emissions after referral
    └── when there is a penalty rate and a referral share
        ├── when the gauge has no new reward per token to estimate
        │   ├── it should apply the penalty before the referral
        │   ├── it should return emissions after penalty and referral
        │   ├── it should align claimed emissions with earned
        │   └── it should return zero earned emissions after claim
        ├── when the gauge has new reward per token to estimate
        │   ├── it should include the cached rate estimate
        │   ├── it should apply the penalty before the referral
        │   ├── it should return emissions after penalty and referral
        │   ├── it should align claimed emissions with earned
        │   └── it should return zero earned emissions after claim
        └── when the projected cumulative varies
            ├── it should fold the projected delta into the estimate
            └── it should align claimed emissions with earned
